    <briefdescription>
<para>Operation cancelled error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1CancelledError" kindref="compound">CancelledError</ref> represents an error where an operation was intentionally cancelled before completion.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>CancelledError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>CancelledError(&quot;Operation<sp/>cancelled<sp/>by<sp/>user<sp/>request&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
